Article 10 (Scope of Interested Persons)
Interested persons under Article 3-6 (3) of the Act (hereinafter referred to as "interested persons") shall be as follows:
1. The lessor or lessee of the relevant housing;
2. The owner of the relevant housing;
3. Among holders of rights recorded in registration records for the relevant housing or its land, persons prescribed by Supreme Court Regulation;
4. A financial institution that succeeds to a preferential repayment right pursuant to Article 3-2 (7) of the Act;
5. Other persons prescribed by Supreme Court Regulation where there are grounds equivalent to those under the preceding subparagraphs.
